<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Basically they had people experiencing O5-11s death from SCP-2718 without actually being dead, and had them somehow control their experiences in order to try and contain death, but ended up shooting her in her face instead? Does this mean all the legions of ancient dead are actually dead now and at peace instead of suffocating endlessly for the rest of forever?</p>
