			<div class="content" id="post-content-3832479">
									

<p>Man.</p>
<p>This may get a bit far, so bear with me.</p>
<p>I am <strong>terrified</strong> of death. It's by far my greatest fear. Beyond any shadow of a doubt.</p>
<p>If nothing else, your tales have replaced that dread with an even worse one: Not dying. I don't know whether or not to hyperventilate, or just stare at a wall, after finishing everything you guys wrote.</p>
<p>I am very rarely horrified anymore, and you guys managed to take my worst fear, subvert it, turn it on its head, and make me <em>feel sorry for not wanting to die</em>. You fucking animals.</p>
<p>I love you. I hate you. You are all terrible people who have terrified me. You are all the best people.</p>
<p>You are all and none of these.</p>
